  "releaseNotes": "- Player: Fixes seek completion notifications during video, audio-only and reverse playback\n\t\t- Downloader: Improves pause, resume and stop handling\n\t\t- Downloader: Fixes premature completion with separate video and audio inputs\n\t\t- Downloader: Introduces explicit completion results and improved error reporting\n\t\t- Downloader: Adds improved progress, output file size, throughput and packet error statistics\n\t\t- Downloader: Handles recoverable packet write errors without interrupting downloads\n\t\t- Demuxer: Tracks terminal read errors for improved download error reporting\n\t\t- Remuxer: Improves timestamp handling, packet validation and output finalization",
